场大巡演.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/5/50/gt46l3uvtt8hf4mp4szstxt4xwpgqfz.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%85%A8%E5%9C%BA%E5%A4%A7%E5%B7%A1%E6%BC%94.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/5/50/gt46l3uvtt8hf4mp4szstxt4xwpgqfz.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%85%A8%E5%9C%BA%E5%A4%A7%E5%B7%A1%E6%BC%94.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/5/50/gt46l3uvtt8hf4mp4szstxt4xwpgqfz.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />全场大巡演+\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>4\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>/\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>范围攻击、对地面\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>0-3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓5-↑3\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓2-↑2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>(穿透伤害)[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"协同号令\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">协同号令</font></span></span>]，选择地形格，对目标范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>格内所有敌人，施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"穿透易伤3\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">穿透易伤3</font></span></span>]（持续2回合）；并额外对[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"灵感星核\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">灵感星核</font></span></span>]造成<font color=\"#ed7950\">100%</font>魔攻值的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"穿透伤害\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">穿透伤害</font></span></span>]，范围内每存在<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>名敌人（不包含灵感星核），伤害倍率提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">80%</font>，本次伤害拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"共鸣•魔术师\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">共鸣•魔术师</font></span></span>]效果，攻击前，攻击提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>。之后再对范围内敌人造成范围[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"灵感伤害\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">灵感伤害</font></span></span>]。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 0-3 3.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/a/a3/gna3oc2cjl54ui7uiti4hvjxnhrilam.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_0-3_3.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/a/a3/gna3oc2cjl54ui7uiti4hvjxnhrilam.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"90\" data-file-height=\"90\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E8%B4%9D%E6%8B%89%E2%80%A2%E9%AD%94%E6%9C%AF%E5%B8%88\" title=\"角色图鉴库/贝拉•魔术师\"><img alt=\"头像 贝拉•魔术师.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/7/7e/a0hndp63mq5sil1xz7x6f9ro1txplpl.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-f